  "title": "ieee80211_radio: Use calculated bitrate if not supplied",
  "description": "For 802.11n if the bitrate is not supplied then the calculated\nbitrate is used. This change does the same for 11ac and 11ax.\n\nSniffer traces taken on recent versions of Macos no longer supply\nthe bitrate for 11ac frames in the RADIOTAP header, this change\nallows the wireless timeline to work with these traces.\n\nFixes #17419.",
